<title>ITALY: Italian M2 rose avge 3.9 pct in qtr end-Oct.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 rose avge 3.9 pct in qtr end-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 grew an adjusted average 3.9 percent year-on-year in the three months to end-October compared with an average growth of 4.1 percent in the three months to end-September, the Bank of Italy said in a statement.</p>
</text>
